        "message": "==<div style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;'>\n  <h2 style='color: #1a1a2e;'>Hello {{$json.body.client_name}},</h2>\n  <p>Welcome to Hogwarts Studio! We are excited to start working with you.</p>\n\n  <p>To ensure we capture your brand's unique style and preferences, please take a few minutes to complete our onboarding form.</p>\n\n  <div style='margin: 24px 0; text-align: center;'>\n    <a href='{{$json.body.onboarding_link}}'\n       style='display: inline-block; background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;'>\n      Complete Onboarding Form\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style='color: #666; font-size: 14px;'>\n    If the button above does not work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser:\n    <br>\n    <a href='{{$json.body.onboarding_link}}' style='color: #6366f1;'>{{$json.body.onboarding_link}}</a>\n  </p>\n\n  <p style='color: #999; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 16px;'>\n    Questions? Reply to this email or contact your account manager directly.\n  </p>\n  <p><strong>Thank You</strong></p>\n  <p>Best regards,<br><strong>Team Hogwarts Studio</strong></p>\n</div>\n",
        "options": {}
